Package: com.hakmicapitalgroup.halo
Name: HCG Halo (Beta)
Version: 0.2.0~beta1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Free public beta demo. HCG Halo draws an animated neon light border around the Home Screen edges and, optionally, around the HCG Nexus panel (needs HCG Nexus 0.2.2~beta1 or a later build with its border interface): Static, Breathing, Colour Flow, Orbit and Sci-Fi Circuit modes, custom colours and gradients, presets and an iPhone 11 Pro Max device profile. Off after installation; enable it in Settings. The Nexus panel border is not yet device-tested.
Maintainer: Hakmi Capital Group
Author: Hakmi Capital Group
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Tag: purpose::extension, role::enduser
